    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get ready to fly\u2014literally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ragdoll LABS</strong> is a chaotic physics-based action game where you control a floppy ragdoll in wild, unpredictable simulations. Every match is a new chance to shine\u2014or to be launched sky-high in the most humiliating way possible. Run, stumble, soar... and laugh. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forget the rules. Especially gravity.</strong><br>Pull off ridiculous stunts, break records (and bones), and unlock customization items to make your ragdoll as stylish as their wipeouts. Dive into nonsensical simulations and capture your finest (or most catastrophic) moments with the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Absurd challenges in crazy levels</strong><br>Dodge avalanches of giant balls, outrun rogue self-driving cars, fire cannons... Every level brings a brand-new, unpredictable, and absolutely hilarious challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd23 <strong>Physics has never been this fun (or painful)</strong><br>Get crushed, run over, blown up, or zapped by lasers. Just laugh it off\u2014grace was never part of the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode and Slow Motion</strong><br>Want to immortalize that epic jump-turned-disaster? Snap the perfect shot or slow it all down for maximum drama. Because every faceplant deserves a close-up.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Get ready to fly\u2014literally.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ragdoll LABS</strong> is a chaotic physics-based action game where you control a floppy ragdoll in wild, unpredictable simulations. Every match is a new chance to shine\u2014or to be launched sky-high in the most humiliating way possible. Run, stumble, soar... and laugh. A lot.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forget the rules. Especially gravity.</strong><br>Pull off ridiculous stunts, break records (and bones), and unlock customization items to make your ragdoll as stylish as their wipeouts. Dive into nonsensical simulations and capture your finest (or most catastrophic) moments with the photo mode.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udfaf <strong>Absurd challenges in crazy levels</strong><br>Dodge avalanches of giant balls, outrun rogue self-driving cars, fire cannons... Every level brings a brand-new, unpredictable, and absolutely hilarious challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd23 <strong>Physics has never been this fun (or painful)</strong><br>Get crushed, run over, blown up, or zapped by lasers. Just laugh it off\u2014grace was never part of the plan.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udcf8 <strong>Photo Mode and Slow Motion</strong><br>Want to immortalize that epic jump-turned-disaster? Snap the perfect shot or slow it all down for maximum drama. Because every faceplant deserves a close-up.</p>",
